<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Us — A Little Corner of Our Story</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream: #FFF7F2;
    --blush: #F6D7D9;
    --rose: #C97B86;
    --rose-deep: #A8586A;
    --plum: #4A2E38;
    --gold: #C9A063;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body{
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--plum);
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, .serif{
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  a{ color: inherit; }

  img{ max-width: 100%; display:block; }

  /* ---------- floating hearts (one orchestrated ambient layer) ---------- */
  .hearts{
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hearts span{
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--rose);
    opacity: 0.35;
    animation: float-up linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float-up{
    0%{ transform: translateY(0) translateX(0) rotate(0deg); opacity:0; }
    10%{ opacity: 0.35; }
    90%{ opacity: 0.35; }
    100%{ transform: translateY(-115vh) translateX(20px) rotate(20deg); opacity:0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .hearts{ display:none; }
    *{ animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
  }

  section{
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(246,215,217,0.55), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 80%, rgba(201,160,99,0.15), transparent 50%),
      var(--cream);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero .eyebrow-mark{
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: rise 1s ease-out 0.1s forwards;
  }

  .hero h1{
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--plum);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: rise 1s ease-out 0.35s forwards;
  }

  .hero h1 .amp{
    display: block;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 0.5em;
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
  }

  .hero p.tagline{
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--plum);
    max-width: 34ch;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: rise 1s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .hero .scroll-hint{
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: rise 1s ease-out 0.9s forwards;
  }

  @keyframes rise{
    from{ opacity:0; transform: translateY(16px); }
    to{ opacity:1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* ---------- section headers ---------- */
  .section-head{
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .section-head .kicker{
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* ---------- gallery ---------- */
  .gallery-grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .gallery-grid .tile{
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, var(--blush), #eec7cb);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168,88,106,0.15);
    transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
  }
  .gallery-grid .tile:hover{
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(168,88,106,0.18);
  }
  .gallery-grid .tile.tall{ grid-row: span 2; aspect-ratio: auto; }

  .gallery-note{
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px){
    .gallery-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .gallery-grid .tile.tall{ grid-row: span 1; }
  }

  /* ---------- timeline ---------- */
  .timeline{
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .timeline::before{
    content:"";
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(var(--blush), var(--gold), var(--blush));
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .t-item{
    position: relative;
    width: 50%;
    padding: 0 3rem 3.5rem;
  }
  .t-item:nth-child(odd){
    left: 0;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .t-item:nth-child(even){
    left: 50%;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .t-item::before{
    content:"";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.3rem;
    width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--rose-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--cream), 0 0 0 6px var(--blush);
  }
  .t-item:nth-child(odd)::before{ right: -5px; }
  .t-item:nth-child(even)::before{ left: -5px; }
  .t-item .t-date{
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .t-item h3{ font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .t-item p{ font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.85; }

  @media (max-width: 700px){
    .timeline::before{ left: 8px; }
    .t-item, .t-item:nth-child(even){
      width: 100%;
      left: 0;
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 2.2rem;
      padding-right: 0.5rem;
    }
    .t-item:nth-child(odd)::before,
    .t-item:nth-child(even)::before{ left: 3px; }
  }

  /* ---------- love letter ---------- */
  .letter-wrap{
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .envelope{
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    width: 110px;
    height: 78px;
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(168,88,106,0.25));
  }
  .envelope .body{
    position: absolute; inset:0;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--blush);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .envelope .flap{
    position: absolute;
    top:0; left:0; right:0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 55px solid transparent;
    border-right: 55px solid transparent;
    border-top: 42px solid var(--blush);
  }
  .envelope .heart{
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 62%;
    transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .letter-card{
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--blush);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--plum);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(168,88,106,0.12);
  }
  .letter-card .sign-off{
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
  }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--rose-deep);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hearts" id="hearts"></div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow-mark">a little corner of the internet, just for us</p>
  <h1>Your Name <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Her Name</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Every love story is beautiful, but ours is my favorite.</p>
  <p class="scroll-hint">scroll down ↓</p>
</section>

<!-- GALLERY -->
<section id="gallery">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="kicker">moments</p>
    <h2>Us, in Pictures</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="gallery-grid">
    <div class="tile tall">add a favorite photo here</div>
    <div class="tile">add a photo</div>
    <div class="tile">add a video</div>
    <div class="tile">add a photo</div>
    <div class="tile tall">add a favorite photo here</div>
    <div class="tile">add a photo</div>
    <div class="tile">add a photo</div>
    <div class="tile">add a video</div>
  </div>
  <p class="gallery-note">this is a placeholder grid — send over your photos and videos and I'll drop them right in</p>
</section>

<!-- OUR STORY -->
<section id="story">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="kicker">our story</p>
    <h2>How We Got Here</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="t-item">
      <p class="t-date">the beginning</p>
      <h3>How We Met</h3>
      <p>Tell the story of the day it all started — where you were, how it happened, what you remember most.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="t-item">
      <p class="t-date">early days</p>
      <h3>The First Date</h3>
      <p>What did you do, what did you talk about, when did you know this was different?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="t-item">
      <p class="t-date">a favorite memory</p>
      <h3>A Trip, a Night, a Moment</h3>
      <p>Pick a memory that still makes you smile and tell it here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="t-item">
      <p class="t-date">today</p>
      <h3>Right Now</h3>
      <p>Where you both are now, and what you're looking forward to together.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOVE LETTER -->
<section id="letter">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="kicker">for her</p>
    <h2>A Little Letter</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="letter-wrap">
    <div class="letter-card">
      <p>My love,</p>
      <br>
      <p>This is where your letter goes — write her whatever you want her to read when she opens this. Tell her what she means to you, an inside joke, a promise, anything at all.</p>
      <p class="sign-off">Always yours,<br>Your Name</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  made with love, for her 🤍
</footer>

<script>
  // ambient floating hearts — decorative, respects reduced motion via CSS above
  const heartsContainer = document.getElementById('hearts');
  const heartChars = ['♡','♥'];
  const count = window.innerWidth < 640 ? 8 : 14;
  for(let i=0; i<count; i++){
    const span = document.createElement('span');
    span.textContent = heartChars[Math.floor(Math.random()*heartChars.length)];
    span.style.left = Math.random()*100 + 'vw';
    span.style.fontSize = (0.8 + Math.random()*1.2) + 'rem';
    span.style.animationDuration = (14 + Math.random()*12) + 's';
    span.style.animationDelay = (Math.random()*10) + 's';
    heartsContainer.appendChild(span);
  }

  // envelope click -> gentle reveal pulse on the letter card
  const envelope = document.querySelector('.envelope');
  if(envelope){
    envelope.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelector('.letter-card').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth', block:'center'});
    });
  }
</script>

</body>
</html>
